      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "UNLEASH SHIRLEY (2) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (20.35) at this track. Returns to a course where she has performed well. Form from her last run is proving strong. Should be very hard to beat this time. SWIFT ELI (1) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing third behind Tralee Nadia (19.98) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Can measure up. PRIVATE JAKE (7) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (20.64) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. ON APPEAL (3) will make his presence felt on the back of recent winning form.",
